  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The studio photographs of François Deschamps are by the credited photographers. All prints are from the collection of François Deschamps ... Painting of photographer Bafin Traoré ... by Jo Kone painter of Mopti"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Perfect bound. Glossy covers. Digital printing. Open edition. Photographs of François Deschamps taken by Malian photographers. Each photograph of Deschamps is accompanied with a photograph by Deschamps of the Malian photographer and his studio. Humane exchange and human relationships are a two-way street, or lane, or cart path. This give-and-give interaction is on display in this set of photographs.</subfield>
  </datafield>
